@startuml
title Plane State Diagram

[*] --> Order

state Order
state Arrival
state Preparation
state Operations
state Maintenance
state OutOfService
state Historic

Order --> Arrival : plane acquired
Arrival --> Preparation : arrival confirmed
Preparation --> Operations : condition and schedule match
Operations --> [*] : scheduled flights remain
Operations --> Maintenance : no more scheduled flights or maintenance required
Maintenance --> Preparation : checked and serviced, ready for operations
Preparation --> Operations : ready for operations
OutOfService --> [*] : plane withdrawn from service

@enduml
